# Raw pi event streams are filtered before archiving (message_update is ~99.8% of
# bytes; one unfiltered run was 181 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB limit). Belt and
# braces in case an unfiltered stream ever lands here.
benchmark/results*/**/stream.raw.jsonl
